   null, null, 1, 2, 85, null, 'total_length', null, null, false, 90),
  ('striped_mullet', null, 'tx-gulf', 'salt', 'note', 'Mullet — all species, their hybrids and subspecies: Daily Bag: No limit. Min Length: No limit. Max Length: 12 inches. May not take from public waters, or possess on board a boat, mullet over 12 inches during October, November, December, and January. No limits apply during other months.', 'https://tpwd.texas.gov/regulations/outdoor-annual/fishing/saltwater-fishing/bag-length-limits/mullet-bag-length-limits', 'TPWD Outdoor Annual 2026-2027 — Mullet Bag & Length Limits', '2026-09-01', '2026-09-02', 1,
