  (null, null, 'tx-gulf', 'salt', 'note', 'TPWD gloss on every species page: the possession limit is equal to double the daily bag limit unless otherwise noted; bag and length limits apply to listed saltwater species; there are no bag, possession, or length limits on game or nongame fish except as listed. Limits apply to aquatic life caught in Texas public waters out to 9 nautical miles, and to EEZ-caught aquatic life possessed in state waters or landed in Texas. It is unlawful to possess aquatic life in Texas waters that was illegally taken in federal waters.', 'https://tpwd.texas.gov/regulations/outdoor-annual/fishing/saltwater-fishing/bag-length-limits', 'TPWD Outdoor Annual 2026-2027 — Bag & Length Limits (limits and restrictions block)', '2026-09-01', '2026-09-02', 1,
